---

This mod ships no Valheim assets. Fonts, sprites and item icons are read from
the running game at load time and are not redistributed. Valheim is the
property of Iron Gate Studio; this project is not affiliated with or endorsed
by Iron Gate Studio or Coffee Stain Publishing.

The screenshots in `media/` of the source repository show the mod's window
inside the running game, and therefore show Valheim's own interface around it.
They document the mod; the game and its art remain Iron Gate's. They are not
part of the distributed plugin.

The package icon, `icon.png`, is rasterised from `icon.svg` by `make_icon.py`.
Both are the author's own drawing, shared with the ForgePlanner website so that
the project looks the same wherever it is listed; no game art is involved.

The only other images bundled with this mod are the four in `art/`: three link icons
(a globe, the Nexus Mods mark and the Steam mark), recoloured from public domain
sources, and a direction arrow drawn for this project. The Nexus Mods and Steam
marks are trademarks of their respective owners
and are used here only to point at this project's pages on those sites; no
endorsement is implied.
